            <div class="w-full max-w-xl">
            <p class="chapter-line font-athletic text-sm uppercase text-white/40">01</p>
            <h2 class="chapter-line mt-4 font-athletic text-3xl font-normal italic text-white sm:text-4xl">Build Fundamentals</h2>
            <p class="chapter-line mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-8 text-white/62 sm:text-lg">
